Benjamin Lewis <bclewis@cs.sfu.ca> wrote:
>Is this really a problem?  In my experience, gnomes with wands of death in
>their starting inventory are much more common than gnomes that drop wands
>of death whey they die, but haven't used them.

Absolutely impossible.  Gnomes cannot be generated with wands of death in
their starting inventory in a standard installation of Nethack.  If the
gnome is carrying a wand of death, either it picked it up from somewhere
or you are playing a rather exotically modified (or exotically buggy)
instance of Nethack.  See function rnd_offensive_item(), muse.c lines
1517-1553.  No 'G', even a gnome king, has a difficulty greater than 6,
so no gnome can ever be generated with a wand of death.

If a gnome zaps you with a wand of death, that's just because he found
it before you did.
